---
title: Aloo Gobi
servings: 2
time: 30 minutes
author: Vedant
---
-- REALLY EASY

Peel @golden potatoes{}.

Dice the @golden potatoes{}.

Heat a #pan{} over medium heat.

Add enough @sunflower seed oil{} to coat the pan.

Add a pinch of @jeera{} and let it sizzle.

Add a pinch of @hing{}.

Add @small gobi{} and saute for a bit.

Add the diced @golden potatoes{} and saute a little more.

Mix in @salt{}.

Cover with a #lid{} and cook until tender, stirring from time to time.

Serve hot.
